# The build context is the REPO ROOT (server/Dockerfile installs the in-repo mem0
# package from it), so keep everything the image does not need out of the context.
# This also keeps local secrets out: server/.env is never baked into an image.
.git
.github
.gitattributes
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.next
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.env
*.log
docs
examples
skills
cli
mem0-ts
tests
integrations
evaluation
